{"1292630": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "3on3 FreeStyle: Rebound", "steam_appid": 1292630, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [3774110, 3530620], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3v3 Online Multiplayer</strong><br>Team up with players around the world and compete in fast-paced, high-energy street basketball matches.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1v1 Competitive Mode</strong><br>Test your skills in intense one-on-one matchups and prove your playstyle and individual performance.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Career Mode (New)</strong><br>Experience a solo PVE mode featuring stage-based progression, roguelike elements, and long-term character growth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Practice &amp; Training Mode</strong><br>Improve your skills through various training systems and prepare for real matches.  </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Single Player &amp; PVE Experience</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a fully developed single-player experience designed to help you grow at your own pace.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stage-based progression with character-specific content</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic difficulty that adapts to your skill level</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roguelike elements that provide a fresh experience every run</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1292630/extras/195740eec436f3afd8b58785019669eb.avif?t=1784108167\" width=1560 height=891 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Free-to-Play Basketball Experience</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A free-to-play basketball game where your time and effort directly translate into meaningful progression.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy both solo and competitive modes with a deep and rewarding experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Real-Time Online Community</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with and against users across multiple platforms in real time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Form teams, compete against rivals, and enjoy seamless matchmaking anytime.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1292630/extras/41258d946d47a7585ff8e0ed3321370b.avif?t=1784108167\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dynamic Street Basketball Gameplay</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master intuitive controls and pull off stylish street basketball moves with ease.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a diverse roster of unique characters, each with their own skills and playstyles, and create your own strategy on the court.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1292630/extras/9bbbcf5aad0afddb1c0ff9000a48df29.avif?t=1784108167\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unreal Engine Lumen Graphics</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the latest update, 3on3 FreeStyle now features <strong>Unreal Engine Lumen-based graphics</strong>, delivering a more immersive and realistic visual experience.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real-time lighting that enhances the atmosphere of each match</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improved reflections and indirect lighting for greater immersion</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic environments that bring the court to life</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience sharper, more vibrant street basketball like never before.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1292630/extras/d6360ed896785b7ba724238b44f30062.avif?t=1784108167\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3v3 Online Multiplayer</strong><br>Team up with players around the world and compete in fast-paced, high-energy street basketball matches.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1v1 Competitive Mode</strong><br>Test your skills in intense one-on-one matchups and prove your playstyle and individual performance.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Career Mode (New)</strong><br>Experience a solo PVE mode featuring stage-based progression, roguelike elements, and long-term character growth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Practice &amp; Training Mode</strong><br>Improve your skills through various training systems and prepare for real matches.  </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Single Player &amp; PVE Experience</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a fully developed single-player experience designed to help you grow at your own pace.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stage-based progression with character-specific content</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic difficulty that adapts to your skill level</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roguelike elements that provide a fresh experience every run</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1292630/extras/195740eec436f3afd8b58785019669eb.avif?t=1784108167\" width=1560 height=891 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Free-to-Play Basketball Experience</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A free-to-play basketba